    "DFA α1 by window end time": "按窗口结束时间查看 DFA α1",
    "DFA α1 describes correlations in beat intervals. Each trailing 120-second window uses 4–16-beat scales, without interpolation or artifact correction. At least 200 complete beats and 98% interval coverage are required. Timing and quality cutoffs are Praxys guardrails, not validated physiological thresholds. Low heart rate may leave too few beats. These results do not diagnose fatigue or determine your training thresholds.": "DFA α1 描述逐搏间期的相关性。每个后向 120 秒窗口采用 4–16 拍尺度，不插值或校正伪差。至少需要 200 个完整逐搏间期及 98% 的时间覆盖。时间和质量限制是 Praxys 的保守规则，并非经验证的生理阈值。低心率可能导致搏动数不足。结果不用于判断疲劳或确定个人训练阈值。",
    "Diagnose Praxys-owned workout delivery without exposing athlete identity or provider workout data.": "诊断 Praxys 管理的训练下发问题，同时不暴露运动员身份或数据来源中的训练信息。",
