    "This value is missing, outside the accepted range, or conflicts with another answer.": "此值缺失、超出允许范围，或与另一项回答冲突。",
    "This will permanently delete <0>{0}</0> and all their data (activities, config, connections, plans). This cannot be undone.": "这将永久删除 <0>{0}</0> 及其所有数据（活动、配置、连接、计划）。此操作无法撤销。",
    "This workout changed elsewhere. The plan was refreshed; reopen the workout to continue.": "这项训练已在其他位置更新。计划已刷新，请重新打开后继续。",
    "This workout stays external unless you explicitly make it canonical in Praxys.": "除非明确采纳到 Praxys，否则此训练会保持为外部训练。",
    "This workout uses a newer portable structure that this editor cannot change safely. Date and notes remain editable; Praxys preserves the structure byte-for-byte.": "此训练使用了当前编辑器尚无法安全修改的较新便携结构。你仍可编辑日期和备注；Praxys 会完整原样保留该结构。",
